           <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2>Dtech DT-7142A (MS) HDMI Splitter Support 4K 1:2 – Reliable 4K Signal Distribution for Dual Displays</h2><p>The Dtech DT-7142A (MS) HDMI Splitter is a high-performance device designed to split a single HDMI source to two HDMI displays simultaneously. Supporting 4K UHD resolution, this splitter ensures crisp, vibrant visuals and seamless audio transmission without signal degradation. Ideal for home theaters, gaming setups, office presentations, and commercial installations, the Dtech DT-7142A provides a convenient and reliable solution for those who need to connect multiple displays from a single HDMI source.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>4K UHD Resolution Support: Delivers stunning 4K video (3840x2160 @ 30Hz) to enhance your viewing experience with ultra-sharp image quality.</li><li>1:2 HDMI Splitter: Distributes HDMI signals from one source to two HDMI displays simultaneously, perfect for multi-display setups.</li><li>High-Quality Audio &amp; Video: Supports high-definition audio formats like DTS-HD and Dolby TrueHD, alongside vibrant 3D video.</li><li>Universal Compatibility: Works with a wide range of HDMI devices including gaming consoles, Blu-ray players, PCs, and more.</li><li>Easy Plug-and-Play Setup: No software or drivers needed, just plug in and enjoy hassle-free installation.</li><li>Compact &amp; Durable Design: The robust and space-saving design ensures it’s perfect for both home and commercial use.</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility